{"id":"797ed4ec0ca2a08f","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-free.md","title":"Free Object","display":"df-free — Free Object","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-free","aliases":["58-df-free","Free Object"],"display":"df-free — Free Object","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-free</span><span>Free Object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free — Free Object"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f12377a238966b6a\" href=\"?note=f12377a238966b6a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md\">../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathcal C,U,A,\\iota\\in V\">\\(S,\\mathcal C,U,A,\\iota\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (forgetful-functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f12377a238966b6a\" href=\"?note=f12377a238966b6a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md\">../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}:V\\to V\\land\\operatorname{Hom}:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}:V\\to V\\land\\operatorname{Hom}:V^3\\to V\\)</span> (object and hom-set operators)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (free-object predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free} \\vdash \\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(A,S,U,\\mathcal C,\\iota) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)\\land\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in U(B)^S\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,A,B)\\;\\left(U(\\bar f)\\circ\\iota=f\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free} \\vdash \\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(A,S,U,\\mathcal C,\\iota) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)\\land\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in U(B)^S\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,A,B)\\;\\left(U(\\bar f)\\circ\\iota=f\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate concerns one set-coded object <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and its universal arrow.  It no longer postulates a set function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:V\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(F:V\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> with the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as domain.</li>\n<li>Free object: universal property; no relations except those implied by category axioms</li>\n<li>Free group on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>: reduced words; reduced concatenation</li>\n<li>Free module: vector space with basis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>; direct sum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigoplus_{s \\in S} R\">\\(\\bigoplus_{s \\in S} R\\)</span></li>\n<li>Free category: on directed graph; paths as morphisms; composition = concatenation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Cohn, Universal Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md","status":"resolved","id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md","status":"resolved","id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (forgetful-functor predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\mathcal C,U,A,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}:V\\to V\\land\\operatorname{Hom}:V^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free} \\vdash \\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(A,S,U,\\mathcal C,\\iota) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\iota:S\\to U(A)\\land\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in U(B)^S\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,A,B)\\;\\left(U(\\bar f)\\circ\\iota=f\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F:V\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigoplus_{s \\in S} R","display":false}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0b0fd432c3af58f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)$ (free-object predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-free.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-556","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-free.md|58-df-free]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["f12377a238966b6a","e637becf421e4e61"]}